Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 17:50:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat: mux multiple subtitle tracks with the next engine

Mirror multi-audio: channel Subtitle Track Languages switches Next to
mux mode with ordered language/title slots; playout fills extra_subtitle
from matching image streams (PGS/DVD/DVB). Text-to-dvdsub is unsupported.

Co-authored-by: rbhun <rbhun@users.noreply.github.com>
